OL,3,GNEWSAVigilante warning as man in van
OL,4,Aapproaches children
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers have been warned not to take
OL,7,Fthe law into their own hands if they
OL,8,Fmount patrols after reports that a man
OL,9,Fin a van has been approaching children.
OL,11,FPolice are investigating three recent
OL,12,Freports involving a man in a dark Ford
OL,13,FTransit van in the Metheringham and
OL,14,FScopwick areas of Lincolnshire.
OL,16,FLincolnshire Police said it was aware
OL,17,Fof discussions about residents
OL,18,Fundergoing patrols in response to the
OL,19,Fincidents.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
