OL,3,GNEWSAVigilante warning as man in van
OL,4,Aapproaches children
OL,5,
OL,6,F"While we understand the strength of
OL,7,Ffeeling around keeping children safe,
OL,8,Fwe would urge anyone considering taking
OL,9,Fpart in patrols to act responsibly,
OL,10,Fremain within the law and avoid
OL,11,Fconfronting or attempting to detain
OL,12,Fanyone based on suspicion or unverified
OL,13,Finformation," it added.
